name: sim.poseToMatrix
description: Converts a pose to a transformation matrix
luaSynopsis: list matrix = sim.poseToMatrix(list pose)
pythonSynopsis: float[12] matrix = sim.poseToMatrix(float[7] pose)
inputs:
1. pose: input pose (array of 7 values [x y z qx qy qz qw])
outputs:
1. matrix: the output matrix (array of 12 values [Vx0 Vy0 Vz0 P0 Vx1 Vy1 Vz1 P1 Vx2 Vy2 Vz2 P2])
